 { Intermediate Moves Jacob Aagaard – Jonathan Rowson, Hamilton 2004 White to play This position is from the tournament where I got my second GM norm. I started excellently with 5½/6 and had a full point lead. I then sailed towards the norm with three draws while Jonathan won his last three games, taking the first prize. Happiness for both, you might say. I would not quite say that this was the case with this game. Jonathan clearly considered himself to be the better player and was out to beat me, but in the end I had the only serious chance to win the game. Unhappiness for both, if you have to ask... } 35. -- 
